	<div role="main" class="main">
		<section class="page-header">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="section_listing_title_bg"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12"><ul class="breadcrumb"><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li>Listings</li><li>Listings</li><li class="active">Listing Rules</li></ul></div></div><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12"><h1>Listing Rules</h1></div></div></div>

			</div>
		</section>
		<div class="container">
<div class="tabs general-tab">
<ul class="nav nav-tabs nav-justified">
<li class="active"><a aria-expanded="true" href="#Rules" data-toggle="tab">Rules</a></li>
<li><a aria-expanded="false" href="#Appendices" data-toggle="tab">Appendices</a></li>
<li><a aria-expanded="false" href="#Procedures" data-toggle="tab">Procedures</a></li>
<li><a aria-expanded="false" href="#Guidance_Notes" data-toggle="tab">Guidance Notes</a></li>
<li><a aria-expanded="false" href="#Waivers" data-toggle="tab">Waivers</a></li>
<li><a aria-expanded="false" href="#Miscellaneous" data-toggle="tab">Miscellaneous</a></li>
</ul>
<div class="tab-content">
<div class="tab-pane active" id="Rules">
<p>In accordance with the requirements of the Corporations Act, SSX has Operating Rules for its market. Its Operating Rules comprise Listing Rules and <u><a href="/en/ssx-roles/business-rules/business-rules/" target="blank">Business Rules</a></u>.</p>
<p>The current Listing Rules took effect from 04 August 2025.</p>
<p>A full set of the current Listing Rules are available for <a href="/public/files/Assets/Pages/files/SSX_Listing_Rules_4_August_2025.pdf" target="_blank">download <i class="fa fa-download"></i></a> and print in PDF format. Full sets of the historical Listing Rules are available here for <a href="#" data-target="#historicalListingRules" data-toggle="modal">download <i class="fa fa-clone"></i></a> and print in PDF format.</p>
<div class="modal fade" id="historicalListingRules" role="dialog" aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="largeModalLabel" tabindex="-1">
<div class="modal-dialog modal-lg">
<div class="modal-content">
<div class="modal-header"><button class="close" aria-hidden="true" type="button" data-dismiss="modal">&times;</button>
<h4 class="modal-title" id="largeModalLabel">Historical Listing Rules</h4>
</div>
<div class="modal-body">
<p>Full sets of the historical Listing Rules are available here for download and print in PDF format.</p>
<table class="table download2-table">
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Date</th>
<th colspan="2">Summary of the changes</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
