<td>Listing Rules effective from 24&nbsp;April 2017</td>
<td><i class="fa fa-file-pdf-o"></i> <a href="/public/files/Assets/Pages/files/SSX_Listing_Rules_-_24_04_2017.pdf" target="blank"><i class="fa fa-download"></i></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
